Medical Treatment: I will order an MRI of the right knee to evaluate the integrity of the ACL. I will prescribe meloxicam 50 mg once daily for pain and swelling. I will also recommend icing the knee and wearing a knee immobilizer. I will also recommend that he use crutches to walk.

